<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>학습 체크리스트 | Nurse Mate</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .check-progress {
            background: #eaf4ee;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 22px;
            margin: 22px 0;
        }
        .progress-track {
            height: 12px;
            background: #d5e5da;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: #43866b;
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: width .3s;
        }
        .check-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 15px;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e5ece7;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 18px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .check-item h3 {
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .check-item p {
            color: #829087;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .check-item form {
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .check-item button {
            min-width: 105px;
        }
        .done-label {
            color: #43866b;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        @media(max-width: 560px) {
            .check-item {
                align-items: flex-start;
                flex-direction: column;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <h2>Nurse Mate</h2>
            <nav>
                <a href="/">대시보드</a>
                <a href="/skills">간호 술기 학습</a>
                <a href="/clinical-logs">임상실습 기록</a>
                <a href="/checklist">학습 체크리스트</a>
                <a href="/practice-schedules">실습 일정 관리</a>
                <a href="/quiz">간호 퀴즈</a>
                <a href="/medical-terms">의학용어 사전</a>
                <a href="/logout">로그아웃</a>
            </nav>
        </aside>

        <main class="main-content">
            <h1>학습 체크리스트</h1>
            <p>간호 술기 학습 상태를 체크하고 나의 학습 진행률을 확인하세요.</p>

            <section class="check-progress">
                <h2>나의 학습 진행률</h2>
                <h1><%= progressRate %>%</h1>
                <p><%= completedCount %>개 완료 / 전체 <%= totalCount %>개</p>
                <div class="progress-track">
                    <div class="progress-fill" style="width: <%= progressRate %>%"></div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>전체 간호 술기</h2>

                <% if (skills.length === 0) { %>
                    <div class="card">등록된 간호 술기가 없습니다.</div>
                <% } else { %>
                    <% skills.forEach(skill => { %>
                        <article class="check-item">
                            <div>
                                <p><%= skill.category %></p>
                                <h3><%= skill.title %></h3>
                                <p><%= skill.description || '술기 내용을 확인하고 학습해 보세요.' %></p>
                                <% if (Number(skill.completed) === 1) { %>
                                    <span class="done-label">✓ 학습 완료</span>
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <span>아직 완료하지 않았어요.</span>
                                <% } %>
                            </div>

                            <form action="/checklist/<%= skill.id %>/toggle" method="POST">
                                <button type="submit">
                                    <%= Number(skill.completed) === 1 ? '완료 취소' : '학습 완료' %>
                                </button>
                            </form>
                        </article>
                    <% }) %>
                <% } %>
            </section>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
